      <div class="watch-unveilling__inner"> 
       <p class="watch-unveilling__description" data-copy-set="C02-002">The <strong>thinnest</strong> Samsung Galaxy Watch yet, Galaxy Watch8 is ready to make an impact. Now, boldly reimagined — from the iconic new <strong>cushion design</strong> to the <strong>Dynamic Lug System</strong> for the snug, comfortable fit — all while performing powerfully with the <strong>3 nm processor</strong>. Experience proactive coaching, from <strong>sleep</strong> to <strong>running</strong> to <strong>holistic health</strong>, that fuses intelligence with individuality. Make the most of your moments with <strong>Galaxy AI</strong> keeping you ahead, topped with a whole-new <strong>One UI</strong> experience.</p> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
