      "articleBody": "The thinnest Samsung Galaxy Watch yet, Galaxy Watch8 is ready to make an impact. Now, boldly reimagined ― from the iconic new cushion design to the Dynamic Lug System for the snug, comfortable fit ― all while performing powerfully with the 3 nm processor. Experience proactive coaching, from sleep to running to holistic health, that fuses intelligence with individuality. Make the most of your moments with Galaxy AI keeping you ahead, topped with a whole-new One UI experience.",
