              <p class="blind" data-copy-set="C03-007">Galaxy Watch8 shows the text Running level test. The screen is scrolled all the way down, and the Start button is tapped. Now, numbers are shown on the display. Time. 12:45. Duration going from 06:46 to 06:47. Distance going from 3.25 to 3.24. Pace 06'39". Heart rate 164. The scene changes. Text Your running level. 4. Congratulations!</p> 
