ations section is enlarged. Text Get notified when your recommended bedtime is approaching. Toggle button is turned on. Scene changes, text at the top: to get notified when it's time to wind down. Galaxy Watch8 and smartphone are side by side in the middle. The same Bedtime guidance alert appears on both devices. Samsung Health logo and text Bedtime guidance, time 8:10 PM, text Try going to sleep between 10:10 PM and 10:40 PM tonight. Galaxy S25 Ultra sold separately. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UI may be different. Bedtime Guidance is available on Android phones (Android 11 and above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or above). Samsung account login required. Bedtime Guidance is based on 3 days of sleep analysis of user's circadian rhythm and sleep pressure. Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Scene changes, text in the middle: Want to improve sleep quality through a tailored program? New text appears: Track your sleep for 1 days, including 1 workday and 1 day off. 1 days goes up to 7 days and 7 moon icons above are marked to indicate 7 nights have passed. New text appears: Then, you'll discover your sleep animal. The moon icons above change to sleep animals. An eighth animal, the penguin, is added to the right. Available on Samsung Health app v6.24 or above and must be paired with Samsung Galaxy smartphones with Android OS 11 and above. Samsung account login required. Requires sleep data of at least 7 days (including 1 workday and 1 day off). Sleep features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not inteded for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Sleep tracking requires wearing Galaxy Watch or Galaxy Ring to sleep. Scene changes, text on the left: Look, you're a penguin! On the right is Galaxy Watch8 displaying Sleep feature notification with penguin icon and text Sleep, 92, Excellent. On the left, new text appears: You can view sleep data, detailed analysis. The notification on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Moon icon, number 92 with triangle and number 3 on the right to indicate the sleep score increased by 3 points. Text Excellent and sleep time 7 hours and 30 minutes. The screen is scrolled down to the bottom. Galaxy Watch8 displays penguin, text Check your habits, and View all button. On the left, new text appears: and check sleep habits. The button on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Sleep coaching feature is onscreen. The screen is scrolled down to the bottom. Galaxy Watch8 displays Show on phone button. On the left, new text appears: Tap 'Show on phone'. The button on Galaxy Watch8 is tapped. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UX/UI may be different. Available on Samsung Health app v6.24 or above and must be paired with Samsung Galaxy smartphones with Android OS 11 and above. Samsung account login required. Required sleep data of at least 7 days (including 1 workday and 1 day off). Intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. Not inteded for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or disease. Please consult a medical professional for advice. Scene changes, smartphone is on the right with Sleep coaching feature onscreen. On the left, text for more details. Screen on smartphone is scrolled down and displays More good habits section, with some good habits checked as done. On the left, new text appears: After 3 to 4 weeks, check how your sleep quality has improved. Screen on smartphone displays Sleep analysis feature and is scrolled down. Sequences shortened. Galaxy S25 Ultra sold separately. Video simulated for illustrative purposes. Actual UX