    <div class="watch-sleep__content"> 
     <div class="common__inner"> 
      <h3 class="common__label" data-copy-set="C013-001">Energy Score</h3> 
      <p class="common__title" data-copy-set="C013-002">Know your energy level. Own your day</p> 
      <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C013-003"> Understand your body and start your day smarter. Galaxy Watch8 analyzes your workouts, sleep patterns and nighttime heart signals to deliver a daily forecast — your <strong>Energy Score</strong>. Check <strong>insight messages</strong> brought to you by <strong>Galaxy AI</strong>, and review each index in detail. Plan your day accordingly to make the most of each moment. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="2">2</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="6">6</a></sup> </p> 
     </div> 
