       <li class="watch-card__item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="sleep-apnea"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C016-001">Sleep Apnea</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C016-002">Look out for signs of sleep apnea</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C016-003"> Sleep deeper, knowing you're in good hands. With <strong>FDA-authorized sleep apnea risk detection</strong>, detect signs of moderate to severe obstructive sleep apnea by looking for oxygen saturation dips overnight with Galaxy Watch8. In the morning, review the details on the <strong>Samsung Health Monitor</strong> app. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="12">12</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="13">13</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="14">14</a></sup> </p> 
         </div> 
