       <li class="watch-card__item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="daily-activity"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C020-001">Daily Activity</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C020-002">Stay motivated with daily goals</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C020-003">Complete your rings and call it a day well spent with <strong>Daily Activity</strong>. Set <strong>daily goals</strong> that match your lifestyle and stay motivated to move. Check how many steps you take each day, how many calories you burn and how long you stay active. Galaxy Watch8 automatically measures your <strong>steps, active calories</strong> and <strong>activity time</strong> throughout the day, helping you make steady progress toward a more active life.</p> 
         </div> 
