       <li class="watch-card__item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="exercise-tracking"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C021-001">Exercise Tracking</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C021-002">Track your moves easily with Exercise Tracking</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C021-003"> Monitor a wide range of <strong>exercise</strong> data — whether you're training at home, lifting at the gym or hiking outdoors. Check detailed data from your <strong>average pace</strong> and <strong>cadence</strong> to <strong>advanced running metrics</strong> and <strong>VO<sub>2</sub> max</strong>. Add your go-to exercises and build your own routine to follow your progress effortlessly. With precise GPS, every move is accurately captured. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="17">17</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="18">18</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="19">19</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="20">20</a></sup> </p> 
         </div> 
