          <p class="blind" data-copy-set="C022-004">An optical sensor of Galaxy Watch8 measures the Vascular Load. Then Galaxy Watch8 is shown, displaying the texts 'Today' and 'Steady', along with a scale with an indicator. At the bottom is the message 'Your vascular load is consistent'.</p> 
