        <li class="watch-card__item watch-card__item--white swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="ecg"> 
         <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
          <div class="watch-card__text"> 
           <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C024-001">ECG</h3> 
           <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C024-002">Take an ECG to check your heart's rhythm</p> 
           <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C024-003"> Follow up on of your heart's condition with <strong>Electrocardiogram (ECG)</strong>. ECG helps you detect signs of atrial fibrillation (AFib) by measuring the electrical activity of your heart and recording it on a graph. You can see how steadily and strongly your heart is pumping in real time and gain valuable insights. Monitor regularly to ensure your <strong>heart's health</strong>. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="27">27</a></sup> </p> 
          </div> 
