        <li class="watch-card__item watch-card__item--white swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="ihrn"> 
         <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
          <div class="watch-card__text"> 
           <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C025-001">IHRN</h3> 
           <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C025-002">Stay alert to heart irregularities</p> 
           <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C025-003"> Have peace of mind with Galaxy Watch8 watching over your heart. Using <strong>Irregular Heart Rhythm Notification (IHRN)</strong>, Galaxy Watch8 analyzes your pulse rate in the background. You will get a notification <strong>if irregularities are detected</strong>, such as those suggestive of atrial fibrillation (AFib), in which case you can take an ECG to get a closer look at your heart's condition. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="27">27</a></sup> </p> 
          </div> 
          <div class="watch-card__image-wrap"> 
