           <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C028-001">Food Tracker</h3> 
           <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C028-002">Check your meal logs at a glance</p> 
           <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C028-003">Log your meals to build healthier eating habits. Record your daily calorie intake right on your wrist with <strong>Food Tracker</strong> to help maintain a balanced diet. Take control of your nutrition by consistently keeping track of what you eat and drink to better understand your nutritional intake. Make informed decisions and eat healthier to enhance your wellness over time and become a healthier you.</p> 
