        <li class="watch-card__item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="body-composition"> 
         <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
          <div class="watch-card__text"> 
           <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C029-001">Body Composition</h3> 
           <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C029-002">Meet your fitness goals with insights</p> 
           <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C029-003"> Measure your <strong>body composition</strong> with just your fingertips, and stay on track with your fitness goals. You can track key indicators like <strong>weight, skeletal muscle and fat mass</strong> by placing your <strong>middle and ring fingers</strong> on the buttons of Galaxy Watch8. Set personalized goals for each index and customize your fitness plan accordingly. Watch your body make progress over time, getting closer to the goals you've set. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="11">11</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="17">17</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="33">33</a></sup> </p> 
