        <li class="watch-card__item watch-card__item--blue swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="medication"> 
         <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
          <div class="watch-card__text"> 
           <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C030-001">Medication</h3> 
           <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C030-002">Get reminders to take your medications</p> 
           <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C030-003"> Stay on top of your <strong>medication intake</strong> with Galaxy Watch8. Enter the pills you take, check information and set alerts. You'll receive <strong>notifications</strong> reminding you to take them on time. Be aware of <strong>possible interactions</strong>, and be informed when certain substances or lifestyle factors may affect how your medications work. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="10">10</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="11">11</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="34">34</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="35">35</a></sup> </p> 
