       <li class="watch-card__item watch-card__item--purple swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="breathing-exercises"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C035-001">Breathing Exercises</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C035-002">Breathe in, breathe out, stay balanced</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C035-003">Take a deep breath. Clear your mind and refocus your thoughts with <strong>guided breathing exercises</strong>, anytime on your Galaxy Watch8. Choose from <strong>three built-in techniques</strong> designed to help you relax, regain focus or find balance, or create one of your own. It's always ready on your wrist whenever you need a mindful moment.</p> 
