       <li class="watch-card__item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="stress"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C036-001">Stress</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C036-002">Maintain control of your stress level</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C036-003">View your daily stress pattern to better manage your mental well-being. Enable advanced measurements to allow Galaxy Watch8 to track <strong>real-time changes in your stress levels</strong> throughout the day, and receive alerts when levels are high. When repeated, ease tension and refocus your mind with breathing exercises.</p> 
