       <li class="watch-card__item watch-card__item--purple swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging="cycle-tracking"> 
        <div class="watch-card__inner"> 
         <div class="watch-card__text"> 
          <h3 class="watch-card__label" data-copy-set="C037-001">Cycle Tracking</h3> 
          <p class="watch-card__title" data-copy-set="C037-002">Know your cycle and plan ahead</p> 
          <p class="watch-card__description" data-copy-set="C037-003"> Stay in sync with your cycle thanks to Natural Cycles' adaptive fertility algorithm. Galaxy Watch8 helps forecast your <strong>upcoming period and ovulation cycles</strong> by monitoring your skin temperature overnight. Make more informed and proactive decisions about your schedule, plan accordingly and go about your day more confidently. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="39">39</a></sup> </p> 
