      <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-watch8/feature/galaxy-watch8-ai-lifestyle.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A woman wearing Galaxy Watch8 raises her arm and looks at it. On the screen is the text 'Ask Google Gemini' with a Gemini icon. A pop-up message nearby reads, 'Hey Google, I need music for an 8-minute-mile pace.'" data-copy-set="C038-003"> 
     </picture> 
    </div> 
