      <div class="watch-custom__text"> 
       <h2 class="common__title" data-copy-set="C040-001">Make it yours, face to band</h2> 
       <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C040-002"> Change your band in a snap, and get ready for whatever's next. Go for the <strong>Sport Band</strong> when you're breaking a sweat, or settle for the soft <strong>Fabric Band</strong> for undisturbed comfort throughout the night. Plus, customize your <strong>watch face</strong> in the <strong>Galaxy Wearable app</strong> with options that range from colors to components. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="43">43</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="44">44</a></sup> </p> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
